 * MAIRIX ERP
 * 21-MAIRIX_ReportsEngine
 *
 * PURPOSE
 * ------------------------------------------------
 * Central reporting orchestration engine.
 *
 * IMPORTANT ARCHITECTURE
 * ------------------------------------------------
 *
 * FILE 20:
 *   FINANCIAL STATEMENTS
 *
 *     Responsible for:
 *       Income Statement
 *       Balance Sheet
 *       Cash Position
 *       Receivables
 *       Payables
 *       Inventory Position
 *       Tax Position
 *
 * FILE 21:
 *   REPORTS ENGINE
 *
 *     Responsible for:
 *       Operational reports
 *       Transaction reports
 *       Inventory movement reports
 *       Sales reports
 *       Purchase reports
 *       Return reports
 *       Collection reports
 *       Vendor payment reports
 *       Expense reports
 *       Commission reports
 *       Loyalty reports
 *       Tax reports
 *       Reference drill-down
 *       Unified dashboard
 *
 *
 * CORE PRINCIPLE
 * ------------------------------------------------
 *
 * REPORTS MUST READ POSTED / CENTRAL DATA.
 *
 * Reports must NOT recreate transaction logic.
 *
 * Reports must NOT:
 *   - create transactions
 *   - modify inventory
 *   - modify customer balances
 *   - modify vendor balances
 *   - calculate tax from scratch
 *   - calculate commission from scratch
 *   - calculate loyalty from scratch
 *
 *
 * SIGN PRINCIPLE
 * ------------------------------------------------
 *
 * Inventory:
 *
 *   SALE              = -
 *   SALES RETURN      = +
 *   PURCHASE          = +
 *   PURCHASE RETURN   = -
 *
 *
 * Financial:
 *
 *   SALE              = +
 *   SALES RETURN      = -
 *   PURCHASE          = -
 *   PURCHASE RETURN   = +
 *
 *
 * Reports should SUM signed effect columns
 * whenever those columns exist.
 *
 *
 * NO DESTRUCTIVE EDITING
 * ------------------------------------------------
 *
 * Reports are read-only.
 *
 ************************************************/


